    <string name="bit_perfect">Bit-perfect USB output</string>
    <string name="bit_perfect_body">For USB DACs on Android 14+. Pocket Box asks Android to send each song to the DAC untouched, at its own sample rate and bit depth. Speed, ReplayGain and the equalizer are turned off while it\'s on. If your DAC or Android can\'t do it for a song, playback continues normally and Audio quality says so.</string>
